{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05300","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得臣字 · 陆景初","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得臣字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九秋光顺豫，重节霁良辰。\n登高识汉苑，问道侍轩臣。\n菊花浮秬鬯，萸房插缙绅。\n圣化边陲谧，长洲鸿雁宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆景初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}